  "description": "Most app founders launch in silence. Umberto made $120K in 24 hours from an app that wasn't even finished. This is his exact launch playbook.\n\n*Free Course: Ship your first iOS app in 7 days* https://clickhubspot.com/gfd \n\nFollow Umberto: https://www.linkedin.com/in/umberto-mezzadra-a6a77113/\nCheck out Floga: https://floga.io/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild\n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - The fastest way to validate your idea\n1:19 - What's your story?\n1:44 - App breakdown and stats\n2:35 - Coming up with the app idea\n4:30 - Lifetime Deals Strategy\n6:44 - Build your own iOS app\n8:18 - The email launch sequence\n11:37 - How to have a great launch (playbook)\n15:22 - Are lifetime deals bad?\n17:44 - Floga app demo\n18:48 - Tech stack\n19:14 - Stop waiting for perfection\n20:08 - Pat and Gus reflections: our takeaways",
